If some stays are here please we are asking for help.. go vote on SMA please.. We need to give them a Bonsang they are almost 3 year old group and haven't received a bonsang yet many younger group have received it already.. Let's work together to give them what they deserve..
here's a tweet about the steps on voting... 
@t

@UCHmYtLDW9MAYMGj40uGGOug that was so harsh... you don't need friends like them, they don't deserve to be called best friend if they can't act one and can't respect you as a human. I'm sorry you're experiencing this right now and I feel bad because I can't do anything but to listen :( 
Just always remember that you're so valid, important, and loved. If you need to cry and let everything out, then that's absolutely fine. The world's cruel ye? but I know you're strong... so just keep fighting. 

Stray Kids and Stays love you and just here for you. You can talk to us, alright? We'll listen :) You'll be fine, just take your time.

Gracias stray kids.

Por demostrarme que la solucion a todo no es la muerte, por hacerme cambiar ese estupida forma de pensar que solia tener, por hacerme saber que no todos los humanos son basura, porque gracias a ustedes he descubrido el lado brillante de esta vida, sin ustedes miles de personas seguirian con problemas, cosas como la depresion/insomnia
Ahora conociendolos me siento plenamente feliz todos los dias de poder haberlos conocido, y saber que talvez vengan a mi pais y que talvez no pueda ir es uno de los peores sentimientos que he sentido));

